      "examplesJson": "[{\"kweyol\":\"Kouman ou yé?\",\"english\":\"How are you?\"},{\"kweyol\":\"Mwen pa konnèt.\",\"english\":\"I do not know.\"}]",
      "commonMistakes": "Forgetting the negation marker when trying to say a negative sentence.",
